        "toolDescription": "Get today's LIVE egg / poultry market rates for India. Returns a list of markets (cities) with today's price, average, and change. Use this ONLY when the user asks for a current / today / live egg price or market rate for a city (e.g. Hyderabad, Pune). Read the returned list and report the price for the city the user asked about.",
